BT /F1 12 Tf 64 466 Td (2. Task description) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 447 Td (You are engaged as a consultant by a mid-sized Australian university. The university has) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 431 Td (published a student wellbeing check-in service that asks enrolled students to record how) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 415 Td (they are coping. The service was released to all students at the start of the teaching) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 399 Td (period. Six weeks later the university has received three complaints, has seen use fall) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 383 Td (away, and does not know whether the service is working as intended.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 362 Td (The case pack in Canvas > Course Resources > Case Pack contains: the published service) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 346 Td (description; the consent notice that students see; three de-identified complaint records;) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 330 Td (and one set of fortnightly usage figures. Nothing in the case pack is a requirement of this) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 314 Td (assessment. The case pack is the material you analyse.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 293 Td (Your task is to produce one written report that \(a\) states the problem the service was) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 277 Td (intended to address and what the available evidence shows about whether it does, \(b\) sets) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 261 Td (out the stakeholders and the needs that the evidence supports, \(c\) proposes a conceptual) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 245 Td (response and justifies it against the evidence and the course literature, and \(d\) identifies) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 229 Td (the risks and ethical considerations that a university would have to weigh before acting on) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 213 Td (your proposal.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 192 Td (Part B of the report is the part that requires you to explain your own design decisions. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 176 Td (explanation in Part B must be your own reasoning, expressed in your own words, and it must) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 160 Td (be traceable to the evidence you cite. Your tutor will read Part B closely.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 64 133 Td (3. Required sections and deliverables) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 114 Td (Submit one PDF containing the following sections, in this order.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 93 Td (  - Part A -- Problem statement: the purpose of the service and what the evidence shows.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 77 Td (  - Part B -- Design rationale: a conceptual response and the reasoning behind each design) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 61 Td (    decision you make.) Tj ET
